\Titleofalgo{ Modified {\algofont{WMR}}\xspace (star network setting)}
\KwIn{parameter $\eta > 0$, threshold set $\set{\ensuremath{\tau}_i : i \in [m]}$}
Initialize $w(\ensuremath{\tau}_i) \gets 1$ for all $i \in [m]$.

conclusions:
satisfies the conditions of Theorem~\ref{thm:lazy_renorm_ratio} 
with $\epsilon = \gamma/\ensuremath{n}$ and $\hat{\epsilon} =
(e-1)\frac{\gamma}{\ensuremath{n}}$
